                                                "sense_id": "9865a3cd-cbe6-33ab-827f-32b915cc5e37",
                                                "text": "Surprised and rejoiced thus far at the unanticipated newness, and the sweet lucidness and simplicity of Isabel’s narrating, […] Pierre now, in handing the instrument to Isabel, could not entirely restrain something like a look of half-regret, accompanied rather strangely with a half-smile of gentle humor."
